 "2255129008188560", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974812_2255129011521893_5568475357922827256_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ktHbWZCCozMQ7kNvwEubcMg&_nc_oc=Adq_tlfq_kH9ANdUlcFdZKZlLDTtpfRCpja9o7Fidnv8l6lYHoWTWXfT-OF9JGvcjzU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTjENKa4Wi2tQrXPbp3zm3_ryLHUkVZI0mDFTp2kWx9hg&oe=6B0DCC21"}, {"file_name": "0.png", "id": "2311328955882136", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036657_2311328962548802_8183369815991323783_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xkVIF-l48MEQ7kNvwEkm607&_nc_oc=AdrTi3QWhczUs8zGk41FfoysreDgvuhgrpL_rRmHd1DsqhznQqJskCcLqhfBCO1BY-I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQjpXZGCCv7hp0-TtlVyubWprze_NAZMEdeyZ_v6Zgn5A&oe=6B0D9B11"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1062674858571716", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240106_1062674861905049_448257407803339299_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wgpdE9KebEIQ7kNvwHLPt7h&_nc_oc=AdoP4dlS7ztqtuL7aRvqd76SfsZkH89yNcTYvJ7N7gahR4VpvbkV7n08FFTYOkwkMZY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRjj_BDSwirqVB1RB4-Oc0I-XAEIVc92aC6BeIN_WHbnQ&oe=6B0DB021"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "4323366401316608", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618910_4323366407983274_8132472247214722963_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MjuhAPcuDpQQ7kNvwFD-lC9&_nc_oc=AdpO-RNq7wLRtylCYc-m0dz8VbpsUz2yduzeZugOvCj7jBOh8_jYgYu2CEwxn-GbEps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTjLac8I-woN_x4d5siNN2nTpBxuc26HwYH9HFETpOG3A&oe=6B0DB24D"}, "display_name": "Echo Eyes", "keywords": ["blind", "impaired", "echoeyes", "ai", "microgestures"], "long_description": "# EchoEyes: AI Vision Assistance for Blind & Low-Vision Users\n\n# \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f See the World Through AI\n\nEchoEyes is an AI-powered accessibility tool for blind and low-vision users.\n\nWith simple microgestures, understand surroundings, read text, detect danger, and navigate with spatial audio\u2014hands-free and intuitive.\n\n{541757971654618}\n\n\n# \ud83c\udfaf Key Features\n\n**\u270b Microgesture Controls**\nNo buttons\u2014just tiny thumb motions to control everything one-handed.\n\n**\ud83d\udc42 Real-Time Environment Understanding**\n\nInstant audio descriptions of people, objects, and details around you.\n{698820153064551}\n\n**\ud83d\udd24 Text Recognition**\n\nSwipe to read signs, labels, screens, and documents instantly.\n{1980090422559372}\n\n\n**\u26a0\ufe0f Danger Detection**\n\nImmediate alerts when hazards are detected ahead or behind you.\n{1522562372352780}\n\n**\ud83e\uddaf EchoRay: Virtual Guide Cane**\n\nTurn your hand into a spatial audio guide cane. Through MR, EchoRay transforms surfaces into 3D sound\u2014closer obstacles sound louder. Navigate by listening, like a white cane.\n{1188999569319260}\n\n# \u270b How It Works\n- **Scan surroundings** \u2192 Thumb Tap\n- **Left / Right Swipe** \u2192 Read text\n- **Detect danger** \u2192 Forward / Backward Swipe\n- **EchoRay** \u2192 Pinch & Hold 3 sec\n\nRaise thumb beside index finger, tap or slide. EchoRay: pinch and hold. Both hands work independently.\n\n{840249464553769}\n# \ud83d\udc8e Benefits\n\n- Independence: Move confidently anywhere.\n- Safety: Real-time hazard awareness.\n- Spatial Awareness: Sense obstacles with 3D audio.\n\n# \ud83c\udf1f Perfect For\n\n- Blind and low-vision users\n- Those with gradual vision loss\n- Anyone needing environmental awareness\n\n", "short_description": "Welcome to EchoEyes, an AI-powered app designed for the blind. With just simple hand micro-gestures, it helps you understand your surroundings."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bbape.com/